(========================================================================================) Tj T*
(YOJANAMITRA SCHEME REFERENCE   FARMERS) Tj T*
(Compiled from official Indian Government sources | Generated: 22 November 2026) Tj T*
(NOTICE: This is a reference document compiled by YojanaMitra. It is NOT an official government publication.) Tj T*
(For authoritative information, visit the official portal URLs listed for each scheme.) Tj T*
(========================================================================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([1]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi \(PM-KISAN\)) Tj T*
(ID: pm-kisan) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://pmkisan.gov.in/) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Department of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare, PM-KISAN official portal and guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Income support for eligible landholding farmer families, transferred directly to) Tj T*
(  beneficiary bank accounts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Landholding farmer families with cultivable land, subject to scheme exclusions and) Tj T*
(  verification by the State or UT.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['A farmer family must own cultivable land recorded by the concerned State or UT.',) Tj T*
(  'Institutional landholders and specified higher economic status categories are) Tj T*
(  excluded; see current official rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  -  6,000 per year per eligible family, paid in three equal installments through) Tj T*
(direct benefit transfer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Use the official PM-KISAN portal to register or check beneficiary status.', 'Follow) Tj T*
(  the portal instructions and State/UT verification process; eKYC is required for) Tj T*
(  registered farmers.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([2]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana \(PMFBY\)) Tj T*
(ID: pmfby) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://pmfby.gov.in/) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare, PMFBY portal and operational guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Crop insurance support for farmers facing notified crop losses from specified natural) Tj T*
(  risks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Farmers, including sharecroppers and tenant farmers, who grow notified crops in) Tj T*
(  notified areas and have an insurable interest.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
