() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The crop and area must be notified for the relevant season by the State/UT.', 'Non-) Tj T*
(  loanee farmers must provide land or cultivation evidence accepted by the concerned) Tj T*
(  State; requirements vary for sharecroppers and tenant farmers.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Insurance cover and assessed claims for covered crop losses under the applicable) Tj T*
(season notification. Premium shares, sum insured and covered crops vary by crop, area) Tj T*
(and season.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Apply through the official PMFBY portal, a bank, Common Service Centre or other) Tj T*
(  authorized channel before the notified season cutoff.', 'Report localized or post-) Tj T*
(  harvest losses through the prescribed channel within the guideline timeframe.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([3]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Kisan Credit Card \(KCC\) and Modified Interest Subvention Scheme) Tj T*
(ID: kisan-credit-card) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2238004&lang=1&reg=3) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Government of India, Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare / Press Information Bureau, 2026 KCC update) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Bank credit for crop production and eligible agriculture and allied-activity working) Tj T*
(  needs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Eligible farmers, including small and marginal farmers; KCC coverage also includes) Tj T*
(  eligible animal-husbandry and fisheries activities under applicable rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ["The applicant must meet the lending bank's KCC and activity-specific) Tj T*
(  requirements.", 'Eligible cultivators, tenant farmers, sharecroppers and joint) Tj T*
(  liability groups may be considered under applicable bank rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - A revolving credit facility for eligible production and allied-activity costs.) Tj T*
(Concessional interest and prompt-repayment incentives may apply under the current) Tj T*
(annual MISS terms; rates and limits can change.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Apply to a participating bank or cooperative lender using its KCC process and) Tj T*
(  supporting cultivation/activity documents.', 'The lender assesses the application and) Tj T*
(  sanctioned credit limit.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([4]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: PMKSY   Per Drop More Crop \(Micro Irrigation\)) Tj T*
