(ID: pmksy-per-drop-more-crop) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://pmksy.gov.in/pdfLinks/FAQ.pdf) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchayee Yojana official FAQ and Per Drop More Crop guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Promotes water-use efficiency on farms through drip and sprinkler micro-irrigation) Tj T*
(  systems.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Farmers in participating States/UTs with eligible land and proposed micro-irrigation) Tj T*
(  work under the approved state/district plan.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Eligibility, supported crops/areas and application requirements are administered) Tj T*
(  through State/UT implementation plans.', 'A farmer must meet the applicable state) Tj T*
(  rules and use an approved system/provider.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Financial assistance toward eligible micro-irrigation costs, subject to the) Tj T*
(current unit-cost limits, approved plans and State/UT rules. Assistance amounts vary.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Contact the State Agriculture/Horticulture Department or designated implementing) Tj T*
(  agency and follow its registration and installation process.', 'Assistance is) Tj T*
(  released after the prescribed installation checks and documentation.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
